#: src/ui/settings.rs:439
msgid ""
"Read receipts are off for your WhatsApp account (see Read receipts below). "
"Direct chats will not send them. When this switch is on, groups still do. "
"Read state syncs between your devices either way."
msgstr ""
"Las confirmaciones de lectura están desactivadas en tu cuenta de WhatsApp "
